---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who is behind Hum Jaise, what it is, and what it isn't.">
  <PageIntro title="About Hum Jaise" urdu="ہم جیسے کے بارے میں">
    <p>
      Hum Jaise means "people like us". It's a small, quiet corner of the internet for neurodivergent
      people in Pakistan, and anyone who sees themselves in that.
    </p>
  </PageIntro>

  <div class="wrap about">
    <section data-reveal aria-labelledby="who-title">
      <h2 id="who-title">Who we are</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          We're a small group of neurodivergent people and people close to us, here in Pakistan. For
          now we've chosen not to put our names on the site. Some of us aren't open about being
          neurodivergent everywhere in our lives, and we'd like the people who come here to have that
          same choice.
        </p>
        <p>
          We're not doctors, therapists or an organisation. We're peers, building something we wish we'd
          had sooner.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-reveal aria-labelledby="why-title">
      <h2 id="why-title">Why this exists</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          A lot of us grew up being called difficult, lazy, too sensitive, too much, or not enough,
          long before anyone had a better word. Much of what's written about neurodivergence comes from
          other countries and doesn't always sound like life here: our families, our schools, our
          gatherings, our languages.
        </p>
        <p>
          We wanted a place where you don't have to translate yourself. Where you can read something
          and think, "oh, that's me", and feel a little less alone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-reveal aria-labelledby="is-title">
      <h2 id="is-title">What this is, and what it isn't</h2>
      <div class="is-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>It is</h3>
          <ul class="star-list">
            <li>A welcome, whether or not you have a diagnosis</li>
            <li>Shared experiences and carefully chosen resources</li>
            <li>The start of a peer community, built slowly and with care</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>It isn't</h3>
          <ul class="star-list">
            <li>A medical service, a diagnosis or a treatment</li>
            <li>A crisis line (see <a href="/resources/#right-now">where to turn right now</a>)</li>
            <li>Selling anything, or collecting your data</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-reveal aria-labelledby="next-title">
      <h2 id="next-title">What we hope comes next</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Today this is a simple website. Over time, and only if we can do it safely, we hope to add:
        </p>
        <ul class="star-list next-list">
          <li>Accounts with a chosen name, so nobody has to use their real one</li>
          <li>Gently moderated conversations, looked after using our <a href="/principles/">principles</a></li>
          <li>Experiences shared by members, in their own words and with their permission</li>
          <li>The whole site in Urdu, and more of the languages people speak here</li>
        </ul>
        <p>None of this exists yet. We'll say so clearly when it does.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-reveal aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Getting in touch</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The easiest way to reach us is the short form on <a href="/take-part/">Take part</a>. It
          doesn't ask for your name.
        </p>
        <!-- Replace with the real contact address once one exists. -->
        <p class="note">Email: coming soon</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about section {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding-block: var(--space-5);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--plaster-edge);
  }
  .about section:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: var(--space-3); }
  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .about section { grid-template-columns: 20rem 1fr; gap: var(--space-5); }
  }
  .about h2 { font-size: var(--step-2); }
  .is-grid { display: grid; gap: var(--space-4); }
  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .is-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  .is-grid h3 { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .is-grid .star-list, .next-list { display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .next-list { margin-block: var(--space-2); }
</style>
